WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:01.701
Har din. Sirf chabane

2
00:00:01.721 --> 00:00:03.806
mein. Kyunki kachha khaana

3
00:00:03.826 --> 00:00:04.693
... khaas kar kachha

4
00:00:05.042 --> 00:00:06.332
maas aur reshedaar phal

5
00:00:06.352 --> 00:00:08.072
... chabana mushkil hota

6
00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:09.218
hai. Aur pachana usse

7
00:00:09.664 --> 00:00:10.350
bhi mushkil.

